      "id": "13525",
      "body": "Hey User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d , I had review of this card and a little bit like the story we reviewed last week, here are my thoughts on a few changes to the Acceptance Criteria section:\n\n  - **Desktop & Mobile*\n      - I think 5 & 6 belong with the Cart user story\n        - With the Cart, is there any designs on what happens if they click on the cart? If so, that Design would also be part of the Cart user story. \n  - **Mobile*\n      - I think 8 - 11 should be placed in the Navigation user story as that’s behaviour we need to build into the nav CSS & JS\n\nHopefully not too much work to move around, but happy to have a call and discuss as well. \n\nThanks Jas!",
