                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Given a product has \"Model is…\" copy populated in the relevant SFCC attribute, when the page loads, then the model height and size worn are displayed on the page."
